 Our old philosophy is a growing community without the budget to provide additional personnel was you give slash titles and you have people doing multiple things.

01:28:20.000 --> 01:28:28.000
 The new philosophy, we can still have some of that, but obviously, it's to provide resources under him so that he is able to actually have a team who can do that.

01:28:28.000 --> 01:28:31.000
 I know we've done different wildlife posts and different things like that.

