 We've heard you.

01:28:36.000 --> 01:28:38.000
 We're addressing your concerns.

01:28:38.000 --> 01:28:40.000
 We've created these two positions.

01:28:40.000 --> 01:28:46.000
 And this is like, we're rolling it forward just so we can point back to it and say, we agree.

01:28:46.000 --> 01:28:47.000
 We were working on it.

01:28:47.000 --> 01:28:50.000
 This is what we're doing to work on it.

01:28:50.000 --> 01:28:51.000
 Has that or no?

01:28:51.000 --> 01:28:53.000
 That has not happened, but it certainly can.

