 And part of that open space plan is going to have direct actions and strategies that they want to implement.

01:29:42.000 --> 01:29:45.000
 So I think that that's why this makes sense.

01:29:45.000 --> 01:29:48.000
 I mean, Todd's been involved with this from day one.

01:29:48.000 --> 01:29:51.000
 He's been assessing this.

