 Well, and even before then, just an announcement.

01:30:24.000 --> 01:30:29.000
 We're so excited to tell you that we have these special positions in our city.

01:30:29.000 --> 01:30:31.000
 Wildlife is so important to us.

01:30:31.000 --> 01:30:33.000
 Open space is so important to all of us.

01:30:33.000 --> 01:30:37.000
 And we want you to know, here are some of the things that we're implementing to do that.

01:30:37.000 --> 01:30:43.000
 Stay tuned for those strategies and objectives that we're like, anything like that.

