 And let me articulate this, because what I'm hearing you is articulate an issue and a desire to elevate this particular issue to a higher priority in terms of accomplishment.

01:36:07.240 --> 01:36:23.420
 And we have more slides to get through. And so I would suggest we have these, you articulate there's an issue, we can elevate it. And I suggest that what we do is we note it and we come back to you with more information and have another discussion elsewhere.

01:36:23.420 --> 01:36:43.860
 Can I just clarify that? I don't know that we necessarily need the priority of certain things to change per se. But I think the getting the word out that it's on the list of things that we're actively doing is useful. Because we want City Hall land purchase. There's a bunch of different things that we want.

01:36:43.860 --> 01:36:50.420
 It's not a 1 through 37 thing. It's 37 things that are being worked on at the same time.

01:36:50.420 --> 01:37:00.860
 Right. And I don't feel like I need to fast track the weeds to the top per se. It's just getting the word out that it's on this big, huge list of things that we're working on, kind of.

01:37:00.860 --> 01:37:16.700
 Just one thing really quick. All this commentary has been very helpful. And just, you know, we have been talking about being more outward facing in our approach to things.

01:37:16.700 --> 01:37:27.300
 Because I think we're all really good at being inward facing. But it's that, and we talked about it, making that leap from good to great is coming out of the way to this.

01:37:27.800 --> 01:37:31.340
 So, yeah. So, this is spot on.

01:37:32.540 --> 01:37:33.420
 That was very well.

