 I actually just send a counsel email, this is going out, and if we don't read it, that's on us.

01:39:15.320 --> 01:39:26.140
 But at least that has the ability to say, okay, here's what it is, this is the details of it, resident A, and this is what the purpose of it is, this is what we're trying to accomplish.

