06:53:07.660 --> 06:53:11.660
 And those are the people who are skittish right now.

06:53:11.660 --> 06:53:17.660
 They're still kind of reeling from the supply chain, still reeling from how COVID impacted travel and things like that.

06:53:17.660 --> 06:53:19.660
 And so they're very risk averse right now.

06:53:19.660 --> 06:53:25.660
